      <text>\(f(x) = {@aa@} \Rightarrow f^{-1}(x) = {@Ansa@}\); \(f(x) = {@bb@} \Rightarrow f^{-1}(x) = {@Ansb@}\); \(f(x) = {@cc@} \Rightarrow f^{-1}(x) = {@Ansc@}\); \(f(x) = {@dd@} \Rightarrow f^{-1}(x) = {@Ansd@}\)</text>
    </questionnote>
